Subject: [PATCH 2/2] perf: add KVC latency stats

Log Yuanrong, Mooncake, and Memcache load, store, and exists latency with transfer bytes or queried key counts. Add an offline parser that summarizes latency percentiles and throughput, with regression coverage.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
